y slots one by one, complete pages, and slowly turn an empty album into a huge collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards will be easy to spot.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others might be hiding right in front of you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/070ddd9d21b6e02dad6a7a2173349c1b.poster.avif?t=1791865556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/070ddd9d21b6e02dad6a7a2173349c1b.webm?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/070ddd9d21b6e02dad6a7a2173349c1b.mp4?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE TASKS AND PAGES TO GET BETTER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a page doesn't just feel satisfying - it also makes you a better collector.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrade points for every finished album page and use them to unlock and improve abilities that make collecting faster, smoother, and more satisfying.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everything can be bought. Complete special tasks - such as finishing specific collections - to unlock unique abilities and permanent bonuses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry more cards. See more. Use magic to find what you need. Deal with duplicates more efficiently. <strong>The more your collection grows, the more tools you gain to tackle the chaos around you.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/b1b1e4fba69f7fa0c638289563e45b3e.poster.avif?t=1791865556\" width=117