y build perfect little stacks?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or don't organize them at all and simply throw them in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's fine too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you can unlock abilities that make dealing with duplicates faster - so whether you enjoy arranging every last card or just want them out of the way, you can play your way.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LITTLE STORY BETWEEN THE CARDS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone was here before you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the room are letters left behind by <strong>Mira Finch, The Wandering Collector<\/strong>, and the mysterious <strong>Grand Collector<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them as you explore and slowly discover their relationship, their history - and how exactly <strong>you<\/strong> became part of it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is there for those who want to find it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cards aren't going to sort themselves either way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/e01c78742cb75402fa3f4e96955b20fa.poster.avif?t=1791865556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/e01c78742cb75402fa3f4e96955b20fa.webm?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/e01c78742cb75402fa3f4e96955b20fa.mp4?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE CARD AT A TIME.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A floor covered in cards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An album waiting to be filled.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of collections to discover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a lot of sorting ahead of you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cards Everywhere!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/1d26adb22f63a3dcaa95c3cc0b0aa4cd.poster.avif?t=1791865556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/1d26adb22f63a3dcaa95c3cc0b0aa4cd.webm?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/extras\/1d26adb22f63a3dcaa95c3cc0b0aa4cd.mp4?t=1791865556\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Cards Everywhere! is a cozy organizing game where you sort through 2,000 scattered cards, collect over 1,500 unique ones, and place them in your collection album. Discover dozens of unique sets and unlock helpful abilities as your collection grows.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Italian, Dutch, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/b0a965c68f3fd352b5c1ec1a2697530c4aea64af\/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1791865556","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/a26bfad6d0629ed696b2166a283e804cda0b6152\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791865556","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5063140\/a26bfad6d0629ed696b2166a283e804cda0b6152\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791865556","website":"https:\/\/armedchicken.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<